cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BayesOmics"
abstract: >-
  Bayesian differential analysis for omics data. The correlation structure
  is captured by a kernel; hyperparameters are optimized by maximum
  likelihood, and groups are compared via posterior distributions and an
  overlapping coefficient.
authors:
  - family-names: "Viellard"
    given-names: "Terence"
url: "https://github.com/terenceviellard/BayesOmics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/terenceviellard/BayesOmics"
license: MIT
